      ("const real albedoOpacity = real(baseMap.a) * real(decal.m_opacity) * decalAttenuation;", "the albedo's opacity"),
      ("real3 blendedBaseColor = BlendBaseColor(real3(baseMap.rgb), real3(decal.m_decalColor), real(decal.m_decalColorFactor), TextureBlendMode::Multiply, useTexture);", "the base map times the colour and its factor (Multiply)"),
      ("surface.albedo = lerp(surface.albedo, real3(blendedBaseColor.rgb), albedoOpacity);", "the albedo is replaced by the blended colour; a fully metallic surface (albedo 0) is still tinted only through this line"),
